WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.067
I like to climb.

2
00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:04.754
Do you like climbing too?

3
00:00:04.755 --> 00:00:10.948
In the park, I like to climb up high in the trees.

4
00:00:10.949 --> 00:00:17.131
At the beach, I like to climb on the big rocks.

5
00:00:17.132 --> 00:00:24.133
At the playground, I like to climb on the jungle gym.

6
00:00:24.134 --> 00:00:33.560
At the zoo, I like to climb up onto the pony.

7
00:00:33.561 --> 00:00:41.552
At the amusement park, I like to climb onto the merry-go-round.

8
00:00:41.553 --> 00:00:48.108
At home, I like to climb on Daddy's back.

9
00:00:48.109 --> 00:00:54.715
At the end of the day, I like to climb onto Mommy's lap.

10
00:00:54.716 --> 00:00:56.918
She tells me stories.

11
00:00:56.919 --> 00:01:01.759
That's the best part of my day.

